<h1 id="hilt">Hilt</h1>
<p>The hilt printed well, I used <a href="https://www.prusa3d.com/product/silver-pla-filament-1kg/">Prusa Silver PLA</a>, and nothing special needed to be done. There are many to pick from online:</p>
